Preheat Oven to 325°

•2 squares unsweetened chocolate (
•¼ lb. butter
•1 cup granulated sugar
•2 eggs
•½ tsp. vanilla
•¼ cup flour 
•¼ tsp. salt
•1 cup chopped walnuts (optional)

